\cf0 Similar to a rowing machine where the split is derived from the calculated work the rower is doing to the flywheel this is based on the work the rower is doing to the boat. It takes more effort or \'93work\'94 to move a boat at the same speed into a headwind as it does a tailwind. pSplit tracks your effort, not your actual boat speed.\
